[al:新概念英语（四）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:Spare That Spider]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:00.39]Lesson 2 | 第2课
[00:08.72]How much of each year do spiders spend killing insects? | 不要伤害蜘蛛
[00:14.83]Why, you may wonder, should spiders be our friends? | 蜘蛛每年有多少时间在捕杀昆虫？
[00:19.15]Because they destroy so many insects, and insects include some of the greatest enemies of the human race. | 你也许会问，蜘蛛为什么应该是我们的朋友？
[00:26.74]Insects would make it impossible for us to live in the world; | 因为它们消灭那么多的昆虫，其中包括一些人类最大的敌人。
[00:30.38]they would devour all our crops and kill our flocks and herds, | 要不是靠食虫动物的保护，昆虫会使我们无法在地球上生活下去，
[00:34.62]if it were not for the protection we get from insect eating animals. | 它们会吞噬我们所有的庄稼，杀死我们的牛羊。
[00:39.77]We owe a lot to the birds and beasts who eat insects | 我们十分感激那些吃昆虫的鸟类和兽类，
[00:43.73]but all of them put together kill only a fraction of the number destroyed by spiders. | 但把它们全部加在一起，也只杀死蜘蛛所消灭的昆虫数量的一小部分。
[00:49.79]Moreover, unlike some of the other insect eaters, spiders never do the least harm to us or our belongings. | 此外，蜘蛛不同于其他一些食虫动物，它们绝不会给我们或我们的财物带来丝毫危害。
[00:58.72]Spiders are not insects, as many people think, nor even nearly related to them. | 许多人认为蜘蛛是昆虫，其实它们不是，甚至和昆虫毫不相干。
[01:05.22]One can tell the difference almost at a glance, for a spider always has eight legs and an insect never more than six. | 人们几乎一眼就能看出两者的区别，因为蜘蛛总是有八条腿，而昆虫的腿从不超过六条。
[01:14.93]How many spiders are engaged in this work on our behalf? | 有多少蜘蛛在为我们从事这项工作呢？
[01:19.25]One authority on spiders made a census of the spiders in a grass field in the south of England, | 一位研究蜘蛛的权威对英国南部一块草地上的蜘蛛做了一次调查，
[01:25.79]and he estimated that there were more than 2, 250, 000 in one acre; | 他估计每英亩草地里有超过225万只蜘蛛，
[01:33.18]that is something like 6, 000, 000 spiders of different kinds on a football pitch. | 也就是说，相当于一个足球场上有大约600万只不同种类的蜘蛛。
[01:39.86]Spiders are busy for at least half the year in killing insects. | 蜘蛛每年至少有半年时间在忙于捕杀昆虫。
[01:44.98]It is impossible to make more than the wildest guess at how many they kill, but they are hungry creatures, not content with only three meals a day. | 它们到底消灭了多少昆虫，我们只能胡乱猜测，但它们是饥饿的小生命，一天只吃三顿可满足不了。
[01:55.88]It has been estimated that the weight of all the insects destroyed by spiders in Britain in one year would be greater than the total weight of all the human beings in the country. | 据估计，蜘蛛一年内在英国所消灭的昆虫的重量，要超过这个国家全部人口的总重量。
